# Challenge Yourself

If you want to push your skills further, try adding:

* 🌙 A dark/light mode toggle
* 🛒 A shopping cart sidebar
* 🔍 Search for drinks
* ❤️ Favorite button on each coffee card
* ⬆️ A "Back to Top" button
* ✨ Scroll animations
* 📱 A responsive hamburger menu
* ⏳ A loading animation

Building this as a **single-page responsive website** with HTML, CSS, and a little JavaScript is an excellent way to practice. It touches on layout, styling, responsiveness, and basic interactivity without becoming too complex.






